      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T07:44:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Later in the series I use `createSettingsUrl`, this seem to deliberately not return a fully qualified URL, so I didn\u0027t want to change that as its used in a lot of places.\n\nYour point is valid, however, this line was simply moved in this change, not modified. I believe what you suggest should maybe be a follow-up change if we think it\u0027s an issue?",
      "parentUuid": "5f2985fd_fd498300",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 199,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 66
      },
