      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T09:35:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "but what is the problem you are trying to fix? AFAICT the function in question should work, it is being used to populate parts of Gerrit e.g. https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master/polygerrit-ui/app/elements/gr-app-element.ts#271, otherwise calling settings would fail from Gerrit anyway right?",
      "parentUuid": "01fbbe16_37794764",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 199,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "b2b051a22958ddab9e920faf8e93642095ce16d6",
